// expect: 14
// SYNTAX §«Labeled call arguments» — a parameter list is a positional
// product, so it may be constructed by FIELD as well as by position, and
// the labels resolve against the declared parameter names. Fully labeled
// here, with a defaulted trailing parameter overridden by label.
//
// This battery exists because the wheel never writes these forms: the
// fixpoint, census and micro battery are all green on what the wheel
// does and silent on everything else (§11 tripwire 3).
//
// The fn was called `spawn_task` until 2026-08-18, which is an op of the
// WasiThreads effect — so through the MANIFEST this declaration was
// unreachable and every call performed the op instead. It passed anyway,
// because the battery concatenates four lib modules and threading is not
// among them. E_FnShadowsOp caught it on the day it armed, and the
// manifest leg beside this battery exists so the next one is caught by a
// gate rather than by luck.
fn queue_task(priority, config, timeout_ms = 1000) = priority + config + timeout_ms

fn main() = queue_task(priority = 5, config = 2, timeout_ms = 7)
